      <div type="clause" n="12">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hl">Hl</ref> 12</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif man oþrum steop asette ðær mæn drincen buton scylde, an eald riht scƚƚ agelde þam þe þæt flet age, ⁊ VI scƚƚ þam þe man þone steap aset, ⁊ cynge XII scƚƚ.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a person takes a cup from another where men are drinking without [the man from whom the cup was taken being at] fault, according to established right let him give a shilling to him who owns that house, and 6 shillings to him from whom the cup was taken, and 12 shillings to the king.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif man oþrum steop asette ðær mæn drincen, buton scylde, an eald riht scll' agelde þam þe þæt flet age, ⁊ VI scll' þam þe man þone steap aset, ⁊ cynge XII scll'.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
